.²2 To dread, fear, be afraid (with <ab>abl.</ab>); {#nASaNkizwa vivasvataH#} <ls>Bk. 15. 39</ls>;
 {#aSaNkiteByaH SaNketa SaNkiteByaSca sarvataH#} <ls>Subhāṣ.</ls>
.²3 To suspect, mistrust, distrust; {#svErdozErBavati hi SaNkito manuzyaH#} <ls>Mk. 4. 2</ls>.
.²4 To think, believe, fancy, imagine, think probable, suspect, fear; {#tvayyAsanne#}
 {#nayanamuparispandi SaNke mfgAkzyAH#} <ls>Me. 97</ls>; {#nAhaM punastaTA tvayi#}
 {#yaTA hi mAM SaNkase BIru#} <ls>V. 3. 14</ls>; <ls>Bk. 3. 26</ls>; <ls>N. 22. 42</ls>.
